+# Text field Undo boundary
+
+ELab compatibility stage 0110 after the existing native stages. No public API
+or model changes. Empty/exhausted text Undo returns no record instead of an
+implicit empty field, preserving its accepted baseline and selection. Normal
+undo/redo, repeated boundary calls, Unicode and branch-after-undo are tested.
+
+Original and output hashes pin the exact prepared dependency. The patch adds
+its regression alongside the implementation. Previous stages are unchanged.
